        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa sī ya Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, galūkaga ūlogeje ū būshū wako kū sī ya Baamoni ūbahangīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, “Gwigwagi ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba MULUNGU.” Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, Īkī a banhū bane mukabawīla, “Būlī ng'wabona!” Aho lyasosohajiwa ī lipandī lyane, na a haho yakenaagūlwa ī sī ya Isilaeli na kūlekwa īlī buyīkī, na a banhū ba Yuda aho baatwalagwa mu būsaamiwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "managi lūūlū gīkī nakūmutūūla mu makono ga banhū ba kīya, mubize sabo yabo. Bakūtūūla ng'hambī jabo ū mu bing'we, bakome na mahema gabo; bakūgalya a matwajo ga mitī ying'we na a mabeelè ga mitugo jing'we būgang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzengo gwa Laba nakūgūgalūcha gūbize madīīmīlo ga ngamīla, nī mizengo ya Baamoni īkūbiza matūūgījo ga ng'holo. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, A bing'we īkī mukatūla ng'hūbi, muyūtūla na hasī bo mhambala jing'we ng'walīja mitindo, mukūyegaga na kayegele kose nguno ya būbi ūbo ng'wīyiganikīlaga sī ya Isilaeli mu ng'holò jing'we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna lūūlū ū nene nakūgūgoloola ū nkono gwane kwilwisha ning'we, namufunye mubize nding'wa kū mahanga. Nakūmukenaagūla ng'wīnge gete ū mu mahanga, namuyagaje mushile gete ū mu masī. Nakūmukenaagūla, hū mukwitegeleja gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa sī ya Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, Nguno a bana Moabu na a bana Seili bakahaya gīkī, Lolagi, ī numba ya ng'wa Yuda ī haha ītikīlile na a mahanga a gangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūlūfunūla ū lūbazu lwa Moabu; nīyīnje ī mizengo ya kū lūbīmbī, kwandīja Bet-Yeshimoti, Baali-Meoni, Kiliataimu, īyo īl'ikūjo lya sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Moabu hamò nī Amoni nakūbinha banhū ba kīya, ībize sabo yabo, a Baamoni batizizūkīlwa hangī ū mu mahanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Moabu nakwīgwisīja nsango. Hūna bakūnideeba gīkī nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa sī ya Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Īkī a bana Edomu bakīmalīla shiilī ī numba ya Yuda, hūna ū mu kwīta gīko būbiza bingīla mu kwihīga kūtaale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alilūūlū Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Nakūgūgoloola ū nkono gwane kwilwisha nī sī ya Edomu nababūlage a banhū baamo nī mitugo jabo. Nakwīyīta ībize buyīkī, bakūbūlagwa būlūgū kwandīja Temani kūshisha Dedani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Edomuu nakwīmalīla shiilī mu nguzu ja nkono gwa banhū bane a Baisilseli, ī Edomuu bakwīyītīla kūlenganīla nū būdaki bone nū būpelanu bone; a henaho bakwīyitegeleja ī shiilī yane; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa sī ya Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Īkī a Bafilisiti bakīīta mu nzīla ya kūmala shiilī, na ng'hana būmala shiilī mu kūlondeela būbi ūbo baalī nabo mu ng'holò jabo, nguno baalī na ng'hūmbū ja kwīkenaagūla ī Yuda kūlwa wanishi bo kale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna lūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nalī hihī kūgūgoloola ū nkono gwane kwilwisha na a Bafilisiti. Nakūbamala a Bakeleti, abo balasaagīīle kū sī ja mbalama ya nyanza nabakenaagūle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbamalīla shiilī mu būkalī būtaale nabagwisīja nsango mu būpelanu bone. Ūlū nūbamalīla shiilī hū bakūdeeba gīkī nalī Seeba.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
